Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.14,0:06:23.36,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}顺从细胞的本能
Dialogue: 3,0:06:22.36,0:06:24.78,Insert - CN,,0,0,100,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}放纵自我
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.36,0:06:27.81,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}撕裂  只因想要那令人沉醉的快感
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.81,0:06:34.04,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}脑海中飞散的道理的残片
Dialogue: 3,0:06:33.16,0:06:35.91,Insert - CN,,0,0,100,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}将其留在过去
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.04,0:06:38.40,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}正是毫无意义的东西
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.38,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}支离破碎  支离破碎
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.38,0:06:41.71,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}疯狂才是常态
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.71,0:06:43.38,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}才会如此沉醉
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.37,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}太过正确的觉悟
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.37,0:06:47.67,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}伤口隐隐作痛
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.67,0:06:49.91,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}正是活着的证明
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.91,0:06:53.10,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}活着真是痛苦  简直束手无策
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.10,0:06:56.09,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}这个世界无聊透顶
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.09,0:07:00.59,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}不论何时  虚构的未来都挤满了蠢货
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.59,0:07:03.70,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}所以试着抛开束缚
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.70,0:07:06.75,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}任性地走下去
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.75,0:07:11.70,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}然后紧紧拥抱绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:23.36,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}この細胞が望む侭
Dialogue: 2,0:06:22.36,0:06:24.78,Insert - JP,,0,0,140,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(lose yourself)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:27.81,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}抉る、恍惚が欲しいから
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.81,0:06:34.04,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}アタマの中散らばった道理の欠片
Dialogue: 2,0:06:33.16,0:06:35.91,Insert - JP,,0,0,140,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(It’s left in the past)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:38.40,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}意味の無いものだから
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.38,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}(バラバラバラバラ)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:41.71,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}狂ってるのが普通
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:43.38,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}だから夢中になる
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.37,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}TRUE過ぎな気づき
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:47.67,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}傷口がズキズキ痛むのが
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:49.91,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}生きている印
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:53.10,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}マジで生き辛くって仕様が無い
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:56.09,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}この世界はしょーもない
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:07:00.59,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}いつだって虚構の未来に馬鹿が群がってる
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:03.70,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}だから箍を外してみるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:06.75,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}ワガママに歩くよ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:11.70,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}絶望をギュギュッと抱きしめて
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.89,0:07:35.12,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我正主宰全场
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.12,0:07:36.57,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}宝贝  把皇冠给我
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.57,0:07:38.26,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}深色皮肤  坚韧无比
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.26,0:07:39.77,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我们奋起  永不沉沦
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.77,0:07:43.12,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}黎明不会来临  闪耀的东京辣妹
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.12,0:07:46.72,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}无法忍受漂亮话  就大胆说出来  懂吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.72,0:07:49.33,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}Yeah  人生高速飞驰
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.33,0:07:52.83,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我没空在这烂得要命的地方打盹
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.83,0:07:55.12,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我今天又降临此处  依旧尽兴游玩
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.12,0:07:58.76,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}这关乎所有人的生死游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.76,0:08:01.69,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}可爱才是最酷的  你懂吧
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.69,0:08:04.81,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}没人能像我们这样炫耀  这是我们的风格
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.81,0:08:07.94,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}袒露心声？才不  这是蠢货干的事
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.94,0:08:11.09,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}但和我的好姐妹  形影不分离
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.62,0:08:13.01,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}这氛围绝了  对吧
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.22,0:08:14.37,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}那老江湖的笑意
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.37,0:08:18.10,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我才不管那臭死人的大叔的痛苦
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.10,0:08:20.65,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}开心就好  火力全开  辣妹之魂
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.65,0:08:23.19,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我才不管  倒满倒满
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.19,0:08:23.59,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}准备好
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.59,0:08:28.63,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}数着钞票  数着钞票  数着钞票
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.63,0:08:29.78,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我是东京辣妹
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.78,0:08:33.06,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}数着钞票  数着钞票  数着钞票
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.06,0:08:35.36,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}无休止地累积上去
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.36,0:08:36.29,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}放马过来
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.29,0:08:39.51,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}堆积如山  不断超越
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.51,0:08:42.59,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}俯瞰着我的摩天大楼
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.59,0:08:47.30,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}划破长空  生出双翼
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.64,0:08:51.51,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我来自那个街区  充斥偷窃打拼
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.51,0:08:54.31,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}如今登上巅峰  现在我将敲定
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.77,0:08:57.88,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我的风格狂野  就是这么牛逼
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.88,0:09:00.98,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}敢惹我的姐妹  就让你见识实力
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.98,0:09:02.97,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}才不  我要继续数钱
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.97,0:09:04.65,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}数着谕吉荣一
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.65,0:09:07.57,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}过时大叔  别来烦我  我正忙着搞钱
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.57,0:09:09.95,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我会听你说  但是一秒一万
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.95,0:09:13.83,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}流这么多汗  真是恶心  不过还是要看这个嘛
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.83,0:09:15.13,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}这氛围绝了  对吧
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.13,0:09:16.73,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}那老江湖的笑意
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.73,0:09:19.42,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我才不管那臭死人的大叔的痛苦
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.42,0:09:23.04,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}开心就好  火力全开  辣妹之魂
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.04,0:09:25.66,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我才不管  倒满倒满
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.66,0:09:26.25,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}准备好
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.25,0:09:30.95,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}数着钞票  数着钞票  数着钞票
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.95,0:09:32.16,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我是东京辣妹
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.16,0:09:35.35,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}数着钞票  数着钞票  数着钞票
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.35,0:09:37.69,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}无休止地累积上去
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.69,0:09:38.71,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}放马过来
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.71,0:09:41.85,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}堆积如山  不断超越
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.85,0:09:44.91,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}俯瞰着我的摩天大楼
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.91,0:09:50.03,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}划破长空  生出双翼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:35.12,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Now I’m runnin' the crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:36.57,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Baby, gimme my crown
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.57,0:07:38.26,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Skin deep, tough like brown
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.26,0:07:39.77,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}we rise, never drown
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:43.12,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}朝なんて来ないギラギラ{\fscx50} {\fscx100}GALs TOKYO
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.12,0:07:46.72,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}綺麗事まぢムリすぐに{\fscx50} {\fscx100}Spit it out huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:49.33,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Yeah, life moving at a stunning pace
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:52.83,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I ain't got no time to be dozin' off in this messed up Space
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:55.12,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I’m out here again today, still playin'
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:58.76,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}this life-or-death game with others and myself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:01.69,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Kawaii’s the baddest, you know that’s true
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:04.81,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Ain’t nobody flexin’ like us, it’s just our crew
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:07.94,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Showin’ your heart? Nah, that’s what fools do
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.94,0:08:11.09,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}But with my homies, I ride, we stick like glue
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:13.01,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}It's a vibe ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:14.37,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}そ、ハスラーの笑み
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:18.10,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}くっせーおぢの苦しみどーでもいい
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:20.65,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}楽しけりゃいい　バチバチメンタリティ　ギャル’s{\fscx50} {\fscx100}魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:23.19,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I don't mind with it pour it up, pour it up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:23.59,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Ready
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.59,0:08:28.63,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Countin' money ho Countin' money ho Countin' money ho
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:29.78,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I’ma TOKYO GAL
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:33.06,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Countin' money ho Countin' money ho Countin' money ho
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.06,0:08:35.36,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}どこまでも積み上げてく
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:36.29,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Bring the smoke
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:39.51,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}うず高く　超えていく
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.51,0:08:42.59,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}私を見下ろす摩天楼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:47.30,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}空を切る　翼生やして
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:51.51,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Came from the block where we hustle and steal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.51,0:08:54.31,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Made it to the top, now I’m closing the deal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.77,0:08:57.88,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}My vibe too raw, yeah, I’m keepin’ it ill
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:09:00.98,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Mess with my squad, you gon' see how we kill
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:02.97,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Nah,I stay countin' money huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.97,0:09:04.65,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Countin’ Yukichi,Eiichi huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:07.57,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}おぢ{\fscx50} {\fscx100}fossil, don't hit me up, I'm on my grind sh*t
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:09.95,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I'll listen to you, but it's 10K a second
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:13.83,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}めっちゃ汗かいてんな　きっしょいな　それでもまあコレ次第だ
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.83,0:09:15.13,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}It's a vibe ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:16.73,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}そ、ハスラーの笑み
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.73,0:09:19.42,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}くっせーおぢの苦しみどーでもいい
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:23.04,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}楽しけりゃいい　バチバチメンタリティ　ギャル’s{\fscx50} {\fscx100}魂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:25.66,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I don't mind with it pour it up, pour it up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:26.25,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Ready
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:30.95,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Countin' money ho Countin' money ho Countin' money ho
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.95,0:09:32.16,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I’ma TOKYO GAL
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:35.35,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Countin' money ho Countin' money ho Countin' money ho
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.35,0:09:37.69,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}どこまでも積み上げてく
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:38.71,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Bring the smoke
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.71,0:09:41.85,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}うず高く　超えていく
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:44.91,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}私を見下ろす摩天楼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:50.03,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}空を切る　翼生やして
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.11,0:11:57.14,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}磨砺感官  杂志架旁
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.14,0:11:59.52,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}佛不言我却知  你的闪光
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.52,0:12:02.24,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}死也选择不了的即为死法
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.24,0:12:05.29,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}执着于  赚钱的路子  做事的方式
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.29,0:12:07.48,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}又将结出那酸涩葡萄
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.48,0:12:10.20,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}以嫉妒供养  以梦想终结的梦想
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.20,0:12:13.40,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}诅咒很简单  祈祷很难办
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.40,0:12:16.00,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}「那时真好」为败犬之辞
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.00,0:12:20.40,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}乐园杳无踪迹
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.64,0:12:26.01,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}警报响彻四方
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.62,0:12:30.08,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}谁也无法在此容身
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.08,0:12:32.75,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}孤独感  是默认的惰性
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.75,0:12:35.57,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}蔓延的理想  仍旧疯狂
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.57,0:12:38.32,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}连呼吸都由不得自己
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.32,0:12:41.26,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}让说过的谎成为谎言
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.26,0:12:44.64,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}一无是处的正义
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.64,0:12:55.32,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}即使世界末日  也能听见你的声音
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.32,0:12:58.53,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}啊啊  怒视神明
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.53,0:13:00.93,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}俯瞰脚下的摩天大楼
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.93,0:13:03.63,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}想要改变的  无法改变的
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.63,0:13:06.56,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我们为何会如此
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.56,0:13:08.52,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}喂  我来见你了
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.52,0:13:12.03,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}因为我爱你  抬头仰望那摩天大楼
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.03,0:13:14.90,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}即使无法传达也要传达
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.90,0:13:17.84,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}直到履行这份约定为止
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:57.14,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}研ぎ澄ます感度　マガジンラック
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.14,0:11:59.52,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}仏は言わんが知ってるお前のフラッシュ
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.52,0:12:02.24,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}死んでも選べないのが死に方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:05.29,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}こだわる　稼ぎ方、やり方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:07.48,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}また実る実る酸っぱい葡萄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:10.20,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}ジェラス供養　夢想で終わる夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:13.40,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}そう呪いは簡単　祈りが難関
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:16.00,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}「あの頃は良かった」は負け犬が言う
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:20.40,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}楽園などどこにもなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:26.01,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}鳴り響く警告のサイレン
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:30.08,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}ここでは誰の居場所もない
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:32.75,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}孤独感　デフォルト惰性
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:35.57,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}はびこる理想　STILL INSANE
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.57,0:12:38.32,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}呼吸すらままならない
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:41.26,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}ついたうそを　うそにしてよ
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:44.64,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}役立たずなただしさ
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:55.32,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}君の声が　世界が終わる日も　聴こえたの
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:58.53,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}ああ　神様を睨みつけて
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:00.93,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}見下ろした摩天楼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:03.63,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}変わりたいの　変われないの
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:06.56,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}僕らは　どうして
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:08.52,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}ねぇ　会いに来たよ
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:12.03,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}愛してるの　見上げては摩天楼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:14.90,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}届かなくても　届きたいの
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:17.84,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}この約束　果たすまで
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.89,0:14:36.16,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}每个人结局都未免有些无趣
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.16,0:14:39.38,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}犹豫的心态  毫无退路可言
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.38,0:14:42.11,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}就将此刻的闪耀
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.11,0:14:44.82,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}尽情挥舞吧
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.96,0:14:50.44,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}渐渐融化的热情  愈发鲜明
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.44,0:14:52.32,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.32,0:14:56.86,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}随着那转瞬即逝的闪光消逝
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.86,0:14:58.46,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.46,0:15:00.22,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}依旧美丽
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.22,0:15:01.79,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}依旧疯狂
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.79,0:15:05.38,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}在充满魅力的牢狱之中
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.38,0:15:08.38,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}你我终将走向消亡
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.38,0:15:11.50,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}别逞强了  你还想清醒多久
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.50,0:15:14.74,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}如此继续下去  你会犯病
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.74,0:15:15.96,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}你做不到一本正经吧
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.96,0:15:18.15,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}不得了了  在爆发前来品尝这份快乐
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.15,0:15:20.97,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}嘉年华就此开幕
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.97,0:15:24.16,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我才懒得理没有解答的无聊问题
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.16,0:15:27.33,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}无休止的尴尬谎言  真是不入流
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.33,0:15:30.13,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}自己造的孽
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.13,0:15:33.29,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}自己去收拾吧
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.94,0:15:38.38,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}渐渐融化的热情  愈发鲜明
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.38,0:15:40.35,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.35,0:15:44.86,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}随着那转瞬即逝的闪光消逝
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.86,0:15:46.55,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.55,0:15:48.24,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}依旧美丽
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.24,0:15:49.83,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}依旧疯狂
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.83,0:15:53.06,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}将在略显崩坏的篇章一隅
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.06,0:15:56.11,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}永远铭刻
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.11,0:15:59.34,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}故事比我想的更为刻薄
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.34,0:16:02.72,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}常识与现实都太过残酷
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.72,0:16:05.83,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}王子也不过是个骗子
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.83,0:16:09.03,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}跑过头的白马最终过劳而死
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.03,0:16:15.04,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我还没能纯粹到
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.52,0:16:21.11,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}能够被人引领
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.72,0:16:38.98,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}直至最后依旧想沉溺于无尽的期待
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.98,0:16:40.93,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}拜托谁来救救我吧
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.93,0:16:42.36,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}谁都可以
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.36,0:16:46.69,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}快来牵起我的手
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.51,0:16:51.95,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}渐渐融化的热情  愈发鲜明
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.95,0:16:53.97,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.97,0:16:58.40,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}随着那转瞬即逝的闪光消逝
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.40,0:17:00.17,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.17,0:17:01.74,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}依旧美丽
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.74,0:17:03.44,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}依旧疯狂
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.44,0:17:06.74,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}在充满魅力的牢狱之中
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.74,0:17:09.80,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}你我终将走向消亡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.89,0:14:36.16,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}みんな最期なんかは味気ない
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:39.38,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}日和る{\fscx50} {\fscx100}Mind{\fscx50} {\fscx100}退路マジ意味ない
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:42.11,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}今此処に在る煌めきを
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.11,0:14:44.82,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}振り翳せよなぁ？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:50.44,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}溶けていく熱情　鮮やかに
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:52.32,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(LA LA LA LA LA LA LA LA)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:56.86,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}瞬く閃光へすっと消えていく
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:58.46,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(LA LA LA LA LA LA LA LA)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:15:00.22,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}綺麗なままで
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.22,0:15:01.79,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}狂ったままで
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:05.38,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}魅力的な牢獄の中で
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:08.38,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}You&Me　4{\fscx50} {\fscx100}に絶えるのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.38,0:15:11.50,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}イキがんなよいつまで正気？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:14.74,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}そのまんまじゃなっちゃう病気
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:15.96,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}真顔無理じゃない？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:18.15,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}ヤバいわ開花前の快楽味わう
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:20.97,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}カーニバルがココで開幕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.97,0:15:24.16,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}解が無いダサい課題は見ない
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:27.33,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}絶え間ないイタいイマイチな{\fscx50} {\fscx100}Lie
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.33,0:15:30.13,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}自分で蒔いた種ぐらいは
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:33.29,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}自分で刈れよなぁ～
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:38.38,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}溶けていく熱情　鮮やかに
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:40.35,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(LA LA LA LA LA LA LA LA)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:44.86,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}瞬く閃光へすっと消えていく
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:46.55,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(LA LA LA LA LA LA LA LA)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.55,0:15:48.24,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}綺麗なままで
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:49.83,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}狂ったままで
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.83,0:15:53.06,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}破綻気味なチャプターの隅へ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.06,0:15:56.11,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}永遠に刻まれるのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.11,0:15:59.34,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}思ったよりストーリーは辛辣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:02.72,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}容赦ないね常識と現実
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:05.83,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}王子様は嘘つきだろうし
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:09.03,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}走りすぎた白馬は過労死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:15.04,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}導いてもらえるほど
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:21.11,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}純白ではないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:38.98,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}果てしない期待に最後まで溺れたいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:40.93,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}どうか救われたい
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.93,0:16:42.36,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}誰でもいいわ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:46.69,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}このアタシの手を取ってくれよ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.51,0:16:51.95,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}溶けていく熱情　鮮やかに
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:53.97,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(LA LA LA LA LA LA LA LA)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:58.40,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}瞬く閃光へすっと消えていく
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:00.17,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(LA LA LA LA LA LA LA LA)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:01.74,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}綺麗なままで
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:03.44,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}狂ったままで
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:06.74,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}愛に満ちた絶望の中で
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:09.80,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}You&Me　4{\fscx50} {\fscx100}に絶えるのさ
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.19,0:20:01.03,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}锈蚀的阴影笼罩着城市
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.03,0:20:07.08,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我仍咬紧牙关  吞下这些破碎消逝的梦
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.08,0:20:10.11,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}讥笑声  冷眼  只是噪音
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.11,0:20:15.72,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}踢开阻碍  打破桎梏  展翅翱翔飞向远方
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.72,0:20:19.66,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}撞破燃烧的大门  让它化作无尽尘埃
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.66,0:20:24.49,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}灼灼目光盯着残破的未来遗骸
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.49,0:20:28.20,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}撕裂那窃窃私语的黑影
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.20,0:20:32.71,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}以沸腾的心跳作答
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.96,0:20:42.97,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}放声呐喊  将虚伪迷茫全数抹除
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.97,0:20:51.80,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}以苦痛为刃  刻下活下的证明
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.80,0:20:56.57,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}打破桎梏  奔赴长夜
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.57,0:21:00.74,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}就算身处这残破不堪的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.74,0:21:05.20,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}唤我之名  去触及那道光
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.20,0:21:10.10,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}继续反抗吧
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.10,0:21:13.29,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}深埋于记忆的牢笼之中
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.29,0:21:19.18,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}收集那曾被我踩碎在脚底的破碎伤痕
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.18,0:21:22.68,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}那驱散我四周黑暗的点点火光
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.68,0:21:27.89,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}永远不要无视你灵魂深处的脆弱
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.89,0:21:31.86,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}奔跑吧  突破极限
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.86,0:21:35.98,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}奔向崭新的黎明
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.83,0:21:55.83,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}释放内心的冲动  把过去和未来统统踏碎
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.83,0:22:04.62,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}以苦痛为光  将这片黑暗填满
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.62,0:22:09.45,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}打破桎梏  奔赴长夜
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.45,0:22:13.53,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}将此刻踩在脚下
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.53,0:22:17.86,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}唤我之名  去触及那道光
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.86,0:22:22.46,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}背负孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.19,0:20:01.03,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Rusted shadows on the city
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.03,0:20:07.08,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I keep biting down on all these broken fading dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:10.11,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Mocking voices, cold eyes, just noise
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.11,0:20:15.72,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Kicking around, break it out, spread the wings{\fscx50\fsp1} {\fscx100}どこまでも遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.72,0:20:19.66,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Break the burning door, crash it into endless dust
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:24.49,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Glaring eyes behold the shattered future’s remains
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:28.20,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}囁いた影を切り裂いて
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:32.71,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}燃える鼓動で答えよう
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:42.97,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}叫んで掻き消して　偽りも迷いも全て
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:51.80,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}痛みを刃に　生きた証を刻め
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:56.57,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}Break the chain, Run through the night
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.57,0:21:00.74,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}壊れそうな世界でも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:05.20,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}Call my name, Reach for the light
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:10.10,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}抗い続けろ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:13.29,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Buried deep in the cage of memories
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:19.18,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Gathering the broken scars oncecrushed beneath my feet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.18,0:21:22.68,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Sparks that light and shine through the darkness  around me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:27.89,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Never close your eyes to the weakness deep inside your soul
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.89,0:21:31.86,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}走り出せ限界を越えて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:35.98,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}新しい夜明けへと
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:55.83,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}解き放て衝動を　過去も未来も蹴散らして
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:22:04.62,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}痛みを光に　暗闇を塗りつぶせ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:09.45,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Break the chain, Run through the night
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.45,0:22:13.53,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}この瞬間をねじ伏せろ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.53,0:22:17.86,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Call my name, Reach for the light
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.86,0:22:22.46,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}孤独を背負って
Dialogue: 1,0:28:36.41,0:28:42.59,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}你留下一条线索  然后消失无踪
Dialogue: 1,0:28:45.54,0:28:50.71,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}对这世界的梦想和希望仍令人怜爱
Dialogue: 1,0:28:53.08,0:28:58.34,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}你的笑容宛如转瞬即逝的泡沫
Dialogue: 1,0:28:58.34,0:29:01.36,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}深藏于美得无法挽留的回忆之中
Dialogue: 1,0:29:01.36,0:29:06.68,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}你在此等候了如此之久
Dialogue: 1,0:29:06.68,0:29:09.10,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}渴望其迎来终结
Dialogue: 1,0:29:13.78,0:29:19.09,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}枪林弹雨之中  勇敢却又孤独而凄凉
Dialogue: 1,0:29:21.54,0:29:27.50,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}身缚重重枷锁  你又归往何方
Dialogue: 1,0:29:29.45,0:29:33.95,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}只为让你能够做自己
Dialogue: 1,0:29:33.95,0:29:37.43,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我将斩断那束光
Dialogue: 1,0:29:37.43,0:29:44.17,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}为了成就自我  我要打破那枷锁
Dialogue: 1,0:29:44.17,0:29:46.64,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}这把利刃将会终结一切
Dialogue: 1,0:30:17.65,0:30:23.43,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}你曾是我的光  耀眼到无法直视你的双眼
Dialogue: 1,0:30:25.15,0:30:30.77,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}但我仍在追寻着你  相信你仍身处那里
Dialogue: 1,0:30:30.77,0:30:34.72,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}我学会了去爱这个世界
Dialogue: 1,0:30:34.72,0:30:38.50,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}因为你仍点燃着我心里的火焰
Dialogue: 1,0:30:38.50,0:30:42.23,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}愿你所照耀的这片地方
Dialogue: 1,0:30:42.23,0:30:46.12,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}永远不会给你带来痛苦
Dialogue: 1,0:30:46.12,0:30:49.70,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}这份心意与日俱增
Dialogue: 1,0:30:49.70,0:30:53.62,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}因为你的笑容始终支撑着我
Dialogue: 1,0:30:53.62,0:30:55.60,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}在我的灵魂深处
Dialogue: 1,0:30:55.60,0:30:57.35,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}你是我的光
Dialogue: 1,0:30:57.35,0:31:01.83,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}依然是我的光
Dialogue: 1,0:31:16.30,0:31:17.73,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}你是我的光
Dialogue: 1,0:31:17.73,0:31:19.57,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}在我内心深处  在这世界上
Dialogue: 1,0:31:19.57,0:31:23.87,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}你将永远存在  化作指路明星
Dialogue: 1,0:31:23.87,0:31:25.15,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}不要紧的
Dialogue: 1,0:31:25.15,0:31:29.28,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}在这世界之外的某处  跨越宇宙的边界
Dialogue: 1,0:31:29.28,0:31:31.41,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}你仍将是我们的救世主
Dialogue: 1,0:31:31.41,0:31:35.12,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}你是我的光
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.41,0:28:42.59,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}You left behind a clue, then disappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.54,0:28:50.71,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Dreams and hopes for the world endeared
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.08,0:28:58.34,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Your smile is fleeting foam
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.34,0:29:01.36,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}In memories too beautiful to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.36,0:29:06.68,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}You' ve waited here so long
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.68,0:29:09.10,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Longing for it to end
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.78,0:29:19.09,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}In a storm of bullets, brave yet forlorn
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.54,0:29:27.50,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Bound in shackles, where you belong?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.45,0:29:33.95,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}To let you stay as you truly are
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.95,0:29:37.43,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I' ll sever the light
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.43,0:29:44.17,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}To become myself, to break the chain
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.17,0:29:46.64,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}This blade will end it
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.65,0:30:23.43,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}You were my light so bright I couldn' t look you in the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.15,0:30:30.77,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Still I kept on chasing believing you' d be right here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.77,0:30:34.72,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I learned to love this world
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.72,0:30:38.50,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}cause you still spark a flame in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.50,0:30:42.23,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}May this place you shine upon
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.23,0:30:46.12,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}never be the one to bring you pain
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.12,0:30:49.70,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}This heart grew day by day
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.70,0:30:53.62,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}because your smile has always carried me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.62,0:30:55.60,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}In my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.60,0:30:57.35,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}You' re my light
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.35,0:31:01.83,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Still my light
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.30,0:31:17.73,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(You' re my light)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.73,0:31:19.57,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Inside of me, in this world
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.57,0:31:23.87,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}you'll live and breathe forever a guiding star that shines on
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.87,0:31:25.15,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(It' s all right)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.15,0:31:29.28,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Somewhere out there in this world beyond the bounds of space
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.28,0:31:31.41,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}you' ll stay our savior
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.41,0:31:35.12,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}You' re my light
Dialogue: 1,0:34:02.85,0:34:07.44,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}这如梦般的日子  为何令人兴奋不已
Dialogue: 1,0:34:07.44,0:34:08.28,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}我在寻找你
Dialogue: 1,0:34:08.28,0:34:10.40,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}你如此冷漠又无情
Dialogue: 1,0:34:10.86,0:34:12.03,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}感觉
Dialogue: 1,0:34:12.03,0:34:14.78,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}是如此重要  所以看着我
Dialogue: 1,0:34:14.78,0:34:15.83,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}看着我
